Canon data files
================

The driver needs three data files from Canon's cnijfilter 3.40 source package
(cnijfilter-source-3.40-1.tar.gz, files 370/database/*):

    cnb_3700.tbl      colour, halftone and tone tables
    cnbpname370.tbl   option names
    cifmp280.conf     option word to id mapping

They are Canon Inc.'s proprietary property and are NOT part of this repository
nor covered by its GPL licence. `make` downloads them into this directory with
scripts/fetch-canon-data.sh and checks them against SHA256SUMS; the licence texts
(LICENSE-cnijfilter-3.40*.txt) come from the same archive. Use of the files is
governed by Canon's "Agreement for the software modules proprietary to Canon or
its licensor" in those texts, which you accept by downloading them. The files
are only read at run time and are never compiled into the programs.

To use a copy of the archive you already have:

    CANON_TARBALL=/path/to/cnijfilter-source-3.40-1.tar.gz make
